      "content": "got it. so if the farmer sees signs of deficiency, like yellowing leaves, but the soil test shows the metals are actually present in the soil, what's the best way to frame the \"unavailability\" issue for them? I want to explain why the plants are effectively \"starving\" despite the nutrients being right there in the dirt.",
